
Build a complete modern, premium, mobile-first web application called “StreakForge” — a private habit-awareness, recovery, self-discipline and personal-pattern tracking application focused on helping users understand urges, maintain streaks, recover constructively from setbacks, identify personal patterns, and build consistent habits.

The application must feel like a premium native mobile app rather than a basic CRUD dashboard.

IMPORTANT PRODUCT PRINCIPLE:

“Open the app → immediately understand your progress → immediately know your next useful action.”

The product should create healthy engagement through meaningful progress, personalization, reflection, useful interventions, achievements and visual feedback.

Do NOT use shame, humiliation, fear, manipulation, compulsive checking mechanics, or punitive mechanics to force engagement.

